                "Nitridboat-Wray NW-HIL pad has Boat BT-8 at 612 C bed RTD, 28 K short of the "
                "640 C nitridation floor, while a pad lamp paints the wall pyrometer at 671 C. "
                "RTD-first should freeze silicon powder; wall-first would push 2.6 t/h onto a "
